OL,3,GNEWSADriver denies causing father of
OL,4,Afive's death by dangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith causing the death by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving of a father of five from County
OL,9,FFermanagh.
OL,11,FDaniel Lavelle died at the scene of a
OL,12,Fcrash between a car and a lorry in
OL,13,FLisnaskea on 25 September, 2024.
OL,15,FThe 40 year old, who lived in Donagh,
OL,16,Fwas travelling in the car at the time
OL,17,Fof the collision at the junction of the
OL,18,FMoughley Road and Crom Road.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
