OL,3,GNEWSADriver denies causing father of
OL,4,Afive's death by dangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FNiall Connolly, 49, of Clonshaugh
OL,7,FHeights in Clonshaugh, Dublin, spoke in
OL,8,Fcourt to confirm his name and to say he
OL,9,Fwas pleading not guilty.
